{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111910197434454016"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-18T20:00:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111910235925610505"],"id":"2111910235925610505","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":29571,"like_count":213,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":61},"text":"Global financial markets face growing risks from AI, bond yields, and cyberattacks. As vulnerabilities increase, policymakers should contain leverage, strengthen debt sustainability, and harden cyber defenses.  \nRead our new blog: https://t.co/jJzedXypzs https://t.co/aYCtvbdV0Q","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2111910235925610505"},{"author_id":"1214528593","created_at":"2026-10-18T19:24:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111901150329139481"],"id":"2111901150329139481","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":6785,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111881963657412903","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Confusing phrasing - “this means”… \n\nIn the blog post that comes after the thing about employee donations and refers to the whole package, not the PBF donation. \n\nThe first thing does not mean 20% at all https://t.co/NneoWM6Mvw","url":"https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2111901150329139481"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:17:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111884340955062274"],"id":"2111884340955062274","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":126,"impression_count":42339,"like_count":645,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":161,"retweet_count":39},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111857344296390929","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Developers are going to be a small part of total token usage over time, as the internal stats on usage at OpenAI and Anthropic both show. And for long-running high value tasks in areas where verification is harder, the benefits for higher \"intelligence\" models are quite large. https://t.co/qTvgVRXfpe","url":"https://x